sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ
    participant P as Payment
    participant I as Inventory
    participant X as Coordinator
    participant R as Restaurant
    participant N as Notification
    Customer->>API: POST /orders
    API->>DB: Save PENDING
    API->>MQ: Publish order.created
    API-->>Customer: 202 Accepted
    par Parallel prerequisites
        MQ->>P: order.created
        MQ->>I: order.created
        MQ->>N: order.created
    end
    N->>DB: Honest receipt notification
    P->>DB: PAYMENT_SUCCEEDED
    I->>DB: INVENTORY_RESERVED
    P->>MQ: payment.succeeded
    I->>MQ: inventory.reserved
    MQ->>X: Both outcomes
    X->>DB: READY
    X->>MQ: order.ready
    MQ->>R: order.ready
    R->>DB: Restaurant notified and CONFIRMED
    R->>MQ: order.confirmed
    MQ->>N: order.confirmed
    N->>DB: Success notification and COMPLETED
    Customer->>API: GET /orders/{id}
    API-->>Customer: Status and timeline
